	"description": "An NVDA screen reader add-on providing virtual buffer support and quick navigation for Markdown documents in Microsoft Notepad (IAccessible and UIA).\nFeatures:\nQuick navigation:\nH / Shift+H: Headings (levels 1 to 6)\nK / Shift+K: Links\nQ / Shift+Q: Block quotes\nL / Shift+L: Lists\nI / Shift+I: List items\nElements List dialog (NVDA+F7) to inspect and jump to structural elements.",
